{"book":"integers","bookTitle":"Integers","concept":3,"title":"Adding integers","grades":"Grade 7","goal":"I can add integers using a number line and counters.","teach":"Adding a <b>positive</b> number moves you <b>right</b> on the number line. Adding a <b>negative</b> number moves you <b>left</b>. With counters, one + and one − make a <b>zero pair</b>. Same signs: add the sizes and keep the sign. Different signs: subtract the sizes and use the sign of the bigger size.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:702px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 104\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"40.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">−6</text><line x1=\"78.3\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"78.3\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"78.3\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">−5</text><line x1=\"116.7\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"116.7\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"116.7\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">−4</text><line x1=\"155.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"155.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"155.0\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">−3</text><line x1=\"193.3\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"193.3\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"193.3\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">−2</text><line x1=\"231.7\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"231.7\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"231.7\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">−1</text><line x1=\"270.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"270.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">0</text><line x1=\"308.3\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"308.3\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"308.3\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><line x1=\"346.7\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"346.7\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"346.7\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2</text><line x1=\"385.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"385.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"385.0\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><line x1=\"423.3\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"423.3\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"423.3\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">4</text><line x1=\"461.7\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"461.7\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"461.7\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><line x1=\"500.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"500.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"85.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">6</text><path d=\"M193.3,57 Q289.2,-3.0 385.0,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M378.0,50 L385.0,57 L383.9,48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"289.2\" y=\"21.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">+5</text></svg></span><div class=\"cap\">Start at −2 and move 5 to the right: −2 + 5 = 3.</div></div>","ex":{"q":"Calculate −7 + 4.","steps":["Start at −7 and move 4 to the right: you land on −3.","With counters: 7 negatives and 4 positives make 4 zero pairs.","3 negatives are left, so −7 + 4 = −3."]},"watch":"−7 + 4 is not −11. Adding a positive number makes the answer bigger.","qs":[{"text":"Calculate −4 + 9.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"5","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Move 9 right from −4.","steps":"1. Rule (adding integers): same signs: add the sizes and keep the sign. Different signs: subtract the smaller size from the bigger size and keep the sign of the bigger size.<br>2. Different signs: 9 − 4 = 5; 9 is the bigger size and it is positive.<br>3. −4 + 9 = 5"},{"text":"Calculate −6 + (−8).","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"-14","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Both negative: add sizes, keep sign.","steps":"1. Rule (adding integers): same signs: add the sizes and keep the sign. Different signs: subtract the smaller size from the bigger size and keep the sign of the bigger size.<br>2. Same signs: 6 + 8 = 14; keep the −.<br>3. −6 + (−8) = −14"},{"text":"Calculate 12 + (−15).","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"-3","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Different signs: subtract 15 − 12.","steps":"1. Rule (adding integers): same signs: add the sizes and keep the sign. Different signs: subtract the smaller size from the bigger size and keep the sign of the bigger size.<br>2. Different signs: 15 − 12 = 3; 15 is the bigger size and it is negative.<br>3. 12 + (−15) = −3"}]}